{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブの時に\n沢山昔の衣装着たよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここにいる理由。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん撮ったと思ったら\nいま見返してみたら\nこれくらいだった(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ◦˙ ˙◦ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは思いつく限りで\n好きな衣装とかある〜？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ChihAnswer！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ともちゃん！さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんずーあみの3人のユニットをやるとしたら、どんなユニット名がいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→プリンシパルduexの時に3人とも\n男役しかやってなかったのを思い出して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装の麗人3人衆。。\nとか寒い名前しか思いつかなかった。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に皆さんは何か思いつく〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トッティさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんはランチとか外で食べる時に混んでても話題のお店入る派？それとも馴染みの店とか気分でぷらりと入っちゃう派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→今日はここに行く！！\nと決めたら中々揺るがないので\n混んでても並んじゃうかも(_ _).｡o○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも何も決めてないときは\nあまり冒険できないタイプの人間だから\nいつもと同じお店に行ってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どん！！！！！！さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・カツ丼、親子丼、天丼に一位、二位、三位と順位付けしたらどんな順になりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→一位 親子丼 ！！\n二位 カツ丼！！\n三位 天丼！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卵が好きなので、卵のメイン順になります。\nあと鶏肉もだーい好きなので。\nでも天丼のタレの染み込んだご飯が\n大好きなので二位と三位は僅差です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"因みに親子丼は好きな食べ物ランキングでも\n上位に入ります。\nというかほぼほぼ一位みたいなものです。\n卵と鶏肉。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショッジさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ライブは始まる前楽しもうと思いますか？頑張ろうと思いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ライブは私にとって\nいつでも何時も楽しいものなので\n頑張ろうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいことは前提なので、\nそれ以上のものを魅せられるように\n頑張ろうと思ってます(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも質問ありがとうm(_ _)m！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「若者のすべて」フジファブリックさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から9月ということで\n夏の終わりにぴったりの曲！\nとても切なくて心にくる。\n切ないけど応援したくなるような\n歌詞の暖かさが好き。\n情景が浮かんでくる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から9月！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早い( ◦˙ ˙◦ )\nびっくり( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月はイベントが目白押しですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は早速！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「乃木坂46 セブン-イレブン限定ミニライブイベント」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"があります\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方いますか〜？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/02/4428375/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織にぎゅ(｡･o･｡)"},{